l direct all units towards F3."},{"seq":964,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c318","house":"rhino","letter":"L358","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":965,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c319","house":"rhino","letter":"L359","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":966,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c320","house":"rhino","letter":"L360","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":967,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1924,"retries":0},{"seq":968,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino offered a truce, which is now in effect. My doctrine suggests taking the East Ford in the first five watches, which is long past. I must observe the enemy movements and exploit any weakness, especially given the truce. I will hold F3 to maintain a strong position, and scout"},{"seq":969,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c321","house":"kite","letter":"L361","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":5100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":970,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c322","house":"kite","letter":"L362","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":5100,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":971,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1614,"retries":0},{"seq":972,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Doctrine is to take West Ford (F1) first, which I hold. I must maintain it. No enemy contact reported, so I reinforce and maintain my position at F1."},{"seq":973,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c323","house":"orchid","letter":"L363","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"